t)\">Mountain Guest House · Genting</b><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Dali · East Gate of the Ancient City · ¥688/night</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 12px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/slide-forest.png\" style=\"width:46px;height:34px;border-radius:6px;object-fit:cover\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><b class=\"trunc-ellipsis\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Woodhouse · Valley</b><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Moganshan · Yu Village · ¥520/night</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"sticky-sc-view\" style=\"height:134px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/slide-summer.png\" style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:6px;object-fit:cover\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><b class=\"trunc-ellipsis\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Summer seaside postcard set ×1</b><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">¥ 39.00</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/photo-cat.png\" style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:6px;object-fit:cover\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><b class=\"trunc-ellipsis\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Cat photography album \"Light on the Windowsill\" ×1</b><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">¥ 128.00</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 12px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/slide-city.png\" style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:6px;object-fit:cover\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><b class=\"trunc-ellipsis\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">City Walking Map · Guangzhou ×2</b><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">¥ 58.00</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--border);box-shadow:0 -2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.06);padding:8px 12px\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Total <b style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--red)\">¥ 283.00</b></span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Go to checkout (4)</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<span class=\"sticky-v\"><span class=\"sticky-v-bar\">top: 0</span><span class=\"sticky-v-lines\"><i></i><i></i></span></span>","when":"Scroll to the top of the header and navigation and click it."},{"demo":"<span class=\"sticky-v\"><span class=\"sticky-v-lines\"><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"sticky-v-bar bottom\">bottom: 0</span></span>","when":"Scroll the bottom operation bar all the way to stick it"},{"demo":"<span class=\"sticky-v\"><span class=\"sticky-v-bar sub\">A</span><span class=\"sticky-v-lines\"><i></i></span><span class=\"sticky-v-bar sub\">B</span></span>","when":"Address book letter, date group title"}]},"usageMocks":{"sticky-table":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"gap:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden\"><span style=\"display:block;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\">任务　　状态</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">登录页改版　进行中</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);padding:4px 8px\">支付流程　已完成</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">长表格滚下来，表头吸在顶部</span>","sticky-cat":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"gap:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden\"><span style=\"display:block;background:var(--bg-hover);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);padding:3px 8px\">A</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);padding:3px 8px\">阿凯</span><span style=\"display:block;background:var(--bg-hover);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);padding:3px 8px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\">B</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);padding:3px 8px\">白老师</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">字母分组标题，滚动时依次接力吸顶</span>","sticky-nav":"<div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><span style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:14px;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2);z-index:2\">筛选栏 · sticky 吸顶</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">滚到顶部才吸住，之前跟着内容走</span>","sticky-top":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brand);color:var(--brand);border-radius:4px;padding:3px 8px;font-size:12px\">position: sticky; top: 0;</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">阈值不写，sticky 永远不吸</span>","sticky-overflow":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"border-color:var(--red)\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">祖先：overflow: hidden</span><span style=\"background:var(--red-light);color:var(--red);font-size:12px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:3px;align-self:flex-start\">可能限制 sticky 的滚动范围</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">检查祖先 overflow、滚动容器和可滚动高度</span></div>","sticky-fixed":"<div class=\"mk-scene\"><span style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:14px;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--red);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--red);z-index:2\">fixed 栏</span><div class=\"mk-skel\" style=\"top:0\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:65%\"></i></div><span style=\"position:absolute;bottom:6px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">fixed 脱离文档流，把第一行内容盖住了</span></div>","sticky-bg":"<div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><span style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text);z-index:2\">透明背景的吸顶标题</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">未设背景色，滚动内容会与标题叠加</span>","sticky-many":"<div class=\"mk-scene\"><span style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:12px;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 6px;z-index:3\">吸顶导航</span><span style=\"position:absolute;top:12px;left:0;right:0;height:12px;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 6px;z-index:2\">吸顶筛选</span><span style=\"position:absolute;top:24px;left:0;right:0;height:12px;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 6px;z-index:1\">吸顶表头</span><div class=\"mk-skel\" style=\"top:26px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:75%\"></i></div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">同时吸附多层控件，会显著压缩内容的可视区域</span>"}}}